Login Page README

Overview

The Login Page is the entry point of the application. It allows registered users to securely access the app by entering their login credentials.

Features

- User login using email/phone number and password
- Input validation for login fields
- Secure authentication
- Error message for invalid credentials
- Navigation to the Home Page after successful login
- Link to the Registration Page for new users

Technologies Used

- Flutter
- Dart
- Material Design

Workflow

1. Open the application.
2. Enter the email or phone number.
3. Enter the password.
4. Click the Login button.
5. If the credentials are correct, the user is redirected to the Home Page.
6. If the credentials are incorrect, an error message is displayed.

Conclusion

The Login Page provides a secure and user-friendly way for users to access the application. It ensures that only authenticated users can use the app's features.